subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T21:30:33Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T21:30:33Z","body":"The single failing job is `TestHASubnetRouterFailoverDockerDisconnect` (HA failover with a Docker network disconnect), which is unrelated to this nil-deref guard in `HandleNodeFromPreAuthKey`. The fix only touches the registration path; nothing in the subnet-router HA failover code is exercised. Looks like a flake on the docker-disconnect side — could a maintainer kick a retest?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4383271551/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SAY-5","id":240962040,"node_id":"U_kgDODlzJ-A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240962040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5","html_url":"https://github.com/SAY-5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SAY-5/received_events","ty